  "description": "ACIBOH crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P n n a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H151 O54 Tb9 Ti2. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Ti1 (Ti) has 6 O neighbors; Tb1C (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb3C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb5C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Ti1C (Ti) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 24 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.337-4.158 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.73-139.77°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C90H151O54Tb9Ti2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 14 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
